@TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress = http://localhost:5241
@token = <access_token>

### Список валют
GET {{TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress}}/currencies?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Получить валюту по коду
GET {{TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress}}/currencies/USD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
